    "title": "THE DECLINE OF THE HARAPPAN CIVILIZATION: AN ANALYSIS OF ENVIRONMENTAL AND CLIMATIC FACTORS",
    "venue": {
        "name": "ShodhGyan-NU Journal of Literature and Culture Studies",
